<html>
  <head>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=Cp1252">
    <meta name="generator" content="Helen">
    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="../../../../javahelp.css">
    <title>Saving a network as...</title>
  </head>
  <body bgcolor="#ffffff">
    <h1>
       <img border="0" hspace="0" s7starttagpos="278" height="32" width="32" src=
      "../../../../images/carmenHelpIcons/c3_32.gif">&nbsp;&nbsp; Saving a network as...
    </h1>
    <table border="1" cellpadding="4" cellspacing="0" bordercolor="#000000" width="476">
      <col width="234">
      <col width="224">
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2" valign="top" width="466">
          <p align="left">
             <b><font size="3">Use case: Saving a network as...</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2" valign="top" width="466">
          <p align="left">
             <b><font size="3">Comment:</font></b> <font size="3">Use case executed when the user
            wants to save the information of a network in a different file than the one which has
            been loaded from.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2" valign="top" width="466">
          <p align="left">
             <b><font size="3">Actor: User</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="234">
          <p align="left">
             <b><font size="3">Normal course</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="224">
          <p align="left">
             <b><font size="3">Alternative courses</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="234">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">1.The user indicates to the program that he/she wants to save the
            information of the network in a file different to its associated file.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="224">
          <p style=" margin-left: 1.25cm; margin-right: -0.02cm; text-indent: -0.79cm;" class=
          "western" align="justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="234">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">2.The program asks the user to type or choose the file where the
            network information will be stored.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="224">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">2.1.If the user does not want to save the network, he/she can cancel
            the operation, ending the use case.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="234">
          <p align="justify">
             <font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="3">3.The program associates the specified file to
            the network.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="224">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">3.1.If the file already exists, the program will report to the user
            and, if the user agrees, it goes to point 4 and if not, it goes to point 2.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="234">
          <p align="justify">
             <font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="3">4.The program executes the use case <i>Saving
            a network</i>.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="224">
          <p style=" margin-left: 1.25cm; margin-right: -0.02cm; text-indent: -0.79cm;" align=
          "justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
